{"seq":2,"slug":"bio-chemistry","title":"理科方向 理科综合 — 生物化学交叉","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/science-comprehensive/interdisciplinary/bio-chemistry","wordCount":1920,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"理科方向-理科综合-生物化学交叉\">理科方向 理科综合 — 生物化学交叉</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>生物化学是生物学与化学深度融合的交叉学科，研究生命体内化学物质的组成、结构、性质和化学变化规律。高中阶段的生物化学交叉知识主要涵盖以下核心领域：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>生物大分子的化学基础</strong>：蛋白质由氨基酸通过肽键缩合而成，核酸由核苷酸通过磷酸二酯键连接。多糖由单糖脱水缩合形成糖苷键。这些生物大分子的化学结构决定了其生物学功能。</li>\n<li><strong>酶的化学本质与催化机制</strong>：酶是生物催化剂，绝大多数是蛋白质。酶通过降低反应活化能加速反应，具有高效性、专一性和多样性。锁钥模型和诱导契合模型解释了酶与底物的特异性结合。</li>\n<li><strong>代谢途径的化学反应网络</strong>：细胞呼吸（糖酵解→丙酮酸氧化→三羧酸循环→氧化磷酸化）和光合作用（光反应→暗反应）本质上是一系列有序的氧化还原反应和基团转移反应。</li>\n<li><strong>遗传信息的化学载体</strong>：DNA 双螺旋结构中碱基互补配对（A-T、G-C）依赖氢键维持，DNA 复制、转录和翻译过程涉及磷酸二酯键的形成与断裂、肽键的合成等化学变化。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"蛋白质结构与功能的化学基础\">蛋白质结构与功能的化学基础</h3><p>蛋白质的四级结构层次体现了化学键与分子间作用力的协同效应。一级结构是氨基酸序列，由共价肽键（−CO−NH−）维持。二级结构（α-螺旋、β-折叠）由主链上相邻肽键之间的氢键稳定。三级结构由多种次级键维持：疏水作用力驱动非极性侧链聚集在分子内部，二硫键（−S−S−）提供共价交联，离子键（盐桥）在带相反电荷的侧链间形成，氢键则在极性侧链间建立。</p>\n<p>蛋白质的功能高度依赖其三维构象。温度升高或 pH 剧变导致次级键断裂，蛋白质变性——空间结构被破坏但肽键未断。这解释了为什么高温消毒能杀灭微生物（酶失活），也解释了为什么胃酸（pH≈2）能帮助消化蛋白质。</p>\n<p>氨基酸的两性解离是理解蛋白质化学性质的基础。在等电点（pI）处，氨基酸以两性离子形式存在，净电荷为零。蛋白质电泳技术就是利用不同蛋白质等电点的差异进行分离。</p>\n<h3 id=\"酶动力学的化学分析\">酶动力学的化学分析</h3><p>米氏方程 v = V_max[S] / (K_m + [S]) 定量描述了酶催化反应速率与底物浓度的关系。V_max 是酶完全被底物饱和时的最大反应速率，K_m（米氏常数）等于反应速率为 V_max/2 时的底物浓度，反映了酶与底物的亲和力——K_m 越小，亲和力越大。</p>\n<p>竞争性抑制剂与底物竞争活性位点，使表观 K_m 增大而 V_max 不变；非竞争性抑制剂与酶-底物复合物结合，使 V_max 降低而 K_m 不变。这些知识在药物设计中具有重要应用：许多药物（如阿司匹林抑制环氧化酶、他汀类药物抑制 HMG-CoA 还原酶）本质上都是酶抑制剂。</p>\n<h3 id=\"光合作用与细胞呼吸的化学本质\">光合作用与细胞呼吸的化学本质</h3><p>光合作用的光反应发生在类囊体膜上。光系统 II（PSII）吸收光能后，水分子被氧化（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2H_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>O → <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>H</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O_{2} + 4H^{+} + 4e^{-}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8547em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），释放的电子经电子传递链传递给光系统 I（PSI），最终还原 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><msup><mi>P</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">NADP^{+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为 NADPH。光反应的本质是光能驱动的氧化还原反应，将水中的化学能转化为 NADPH 和 ATP 中的化学能。</p>\n<p>暗反应（Calvin 循环）在叶绿体基质中进行。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CO_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 被 RuBisCO 酶固定到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 化合物（RuBP）上，生成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 化合物（3-PGA），随后被 NADPH 还原为 G3P，部分 G3P 用于合成葡萄糖，其余再生 RuBP。整个过程是一系列酶促的碳骨架重排和还原反应。</p>\n<p>细胞呼吸是光合作用的逆过程。葡萄糖经糖酵解产生丙酮酸，丙酮酸进入线粒体基质经三羧酸循环彻底氧化为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CO_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，产生的 NADH 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">FADH_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在内膜上经电子传递链传递电子，最终将 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 还原为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>O，释放的能量通过化学渗透偶联合成 ATP。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>某蛋白质含有 100 个氨基酸残基。计算该蛋白质通过脱水缩合形成时释放的水分子数，并说明该蛋白质至少含有多少个游离的氨基和羧基。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>在 37°C 下，某酶催化反应的 K_m = 2 mmol/L，V_max = 100 μmol/min。计算当底物浓度为 10 mmol/L 时的反应速率。如果加入竞争性抑制剂使表观 K_m 增大为 6 mmol/L，同样底物浓度下反应速率变为多少？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>光合作用中，每固定 1 分子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CO_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 需要消耗多少分子 ATP 和 NADPH？一个葡萄糖分子的合成需要固定多少分子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CO_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较有氧呼吸和无氧呼吸（酒精发酵）中葡萄糖的能量利用效率。为什么有氧呼吸能产生更多的 ATP？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>现代生物化学研究正经历深刻变革。结构生物学利用 X 射线晶体学和冷冻电镜技术解析蛋白质的原子级三维结构，2024 年诺贝尔化学奖授予了利用 AI 预测蛋白质结构的研究者（AlphaFold）。代谢组学通过质谱和核磁共振技术同时检测细胞内数千种代谢产物，绘制完整的代谢网络图谱。</p>\n<p>合成生物学则尝试从零开始设计和构建生物系统。Craig Venter 团队在 2010 年合成了第一个完全由人工 DNA 控制的细胞，开创了&quot;设计生命&quot;的新纪元。基因编辑技术 CRISPR-Cas9 使定点修改 DNA 序列成为可能，其化学本质是由引导 RNA 定位的核酸内切酶反应。</p>\n<p>对于有志于生物化学方向的同学，建议阅读 Lehninger《生物化学原理》的前几章，建立对生物大分子和代谢途径的系统认识。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-相关文档\">本 hub 相关文档</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"physics-chemistry\">物理化学交叉</a>（本 hub 兄弟篇）——&quot;酶通过降低活化能加速反应&quot;的定量基础（阿伦尼乌斯方程、催化剂改变反应路径而不改平衡位置）在那一篇系统讲解，两篇合读才能完整回答&quot;酶为什么又快又专一&quot;。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../science-frontiers/gene-editing\">基因编辑</a>（本 hub 兄弟篇）——拓展中提到的 CRISPR-Cas9 在那一篇完整展开：核酸内切酶的切割机制、DNA 修复途径的选择，正是本篇 DNA 化学结构与酶催化知识的尖端应用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>生物化学交叉揭示了生命现象的化学本质：蛋白质的结构与功能依赖化学键与分子间作用力，酶催化遵循化学动力学规律，代谢途径本质上是有序的化学反应网络，遗传信息的存储和传递以核酸的化学结构为基础。理解生物与化学的交叉融合，不仅有助于理科综合考试，更是通向医学、药学、农学、环境科学等应用领域的桥梁。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"理科方向 理科综合 — 生物化学交叉","id":"理科方向-理科综合-生物化学交叉"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"蛋白质结构与功能的化学基础","id":"蛋白质结构与功能的化学基础"},{"level":3,"text":"酶动力学的化学分析","id":"酶动力学的化学分析"},{"level":3,"text":"光合作用与细胞呼吸的化学本质","id":"光合作用与细胞呼吸的化学本质"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"本 hub 相关文档","id":"本-hub-相关文档"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"理科方向 理科综合 — 物理化学交叉","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/science-comprehensive/interdisciplinary/physics-chemistry"},"next":{"title":"理科方向 理科综合 — 科学建模","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/science-comprehensive/interdisciplinary/science-modeling"}}